Since you have 3 sentences and a max of 3 chunks, this creates perfectly balanced work where each agent analyzes the sentiment of exactly one sentence. This approach maximizes parallelization while keeping the work evenly distributed.

Each chunk will be completely independent - an agent can analyze the sentiment of its assigned sentence without needing any information from the other sentences.

